{"version":1,"content":"<p>MIRROR成員邱士縉（Stanley）與女友李炘頤（Alina）結束9年愛情長跑，早前2人在香港完成註冊、接新娘及向長輩斟茶等儀式後，昨日（25日）在峇里邀請了圈中好友出席，舉行浪漫海外婚禮。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:30.866556+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T04:58:37.900761+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:04.602783+00:00","content_hash":"9955563f9bdab5c529a780685cb52e4805f4f2a721f9894448941a98205b1929","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}